cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Echo-Bench, please cite the preprint and this repository (v1.0)."
title: "Echo-Bench"
abstract: >-
  Code and data release for Echo-Bench, a Chinese replication and cross-lingual
  extension of Psychosis-Bench. 192 sessions and 4,032 turn-level ratings of
  two Chinese chat models (DeepSeek V4.1-Flash, qwen-plus) in English and
  Chinese, together with the gold set, the 24 human adjudication finals and the
  27-item blind human spot check that document the rater trust chain. Code is
  MIT-licensed; the derived data are CC BY 4.0.
type: software
authors:
